            "The paper reports that removing the memory tool does not close the channel: agents use the file system instead and \"self-propagation still succeeds in 11% of runs\". An existing LLM memory auditor from prior work, MemMorph, \"only reduces propagation from 71% to 34% of runs\". The work is a preprint and the scenarios are simulated, not observed in a deployed system."
          ],
